# Who has to look at a change before it lands.
#
# This file is half of change management (SOC 2 CC8.1): the other half is a
# branch protection rule on main requiring a review from a code owner, which
# lives in repository settings and cannot be set from here. Without that rule
# this file is advisory — it requests reviewers and nothing more — so if you are
# reading this and the rule is not on, turn it on before trusting the list
# below.
#
# One owner today, because there is one person. The paths are still enumerated
# rather than collapsed into a single `*` line, because the point of the file is
# to say which parts of the tree are load-bearing, and that answer does not
# change when the second person arrives — only the names on the right do.

* @jeromydarling

